{"id": "unknown-2026-07-02-010", "date": "2026-07-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["guidance"], "sentiment": {"label": "neutral", "score": 0.0, "keywords": []}, "importance": {"score": 0.5, "reasons": []}, "title": "EPA revisits PFAS in biosolids guidance, criticizing Biden-era report", "content": "<figure><div><img src=\"https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/afK8sqFWkq0iHX7WD90eVehpLmdpaA3xIfl2k01kKDY/g:ce/rs:fill:1600:900:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9HZXR0eUltYWdlcy0yMjI5OTgyODkyLmpwZw==.webp\"/></div></figure><p>The agency released a new guidance document on Wednesday emphasizing industrial pretreatment and is&nbsp;seeking public comment. It also claimed last year&rsquo;s assessment was &ldquo;disconnected from real-world conditions.&rdquo;</p>", "sources": [{"name": "waste_dive", "url": "https://www.wastedive.com/news/epa-revisit-pfas-biosolids-guidance-criticizing-biden-era-report/824326/", "type": "rss"}]}
{"id": "unknown-2026-07-02-011", "date": "2026-07-02", "time_tags": {"year": 2026, "quarter": "Q3", "month": 7, "week": 27, "weekday": "Thu"}, "entities": {"companies": [], "customers": [], "suppliers": []}, "topics": ["earnings"], "sentiment": {"label": "negative", "score": -0.5, "keywords": ["delay"]}, "importance": {"score": 0.75, "reasons": ["涉及財報"]}, "title": "Key EPR laws and right-to-repair updates moved forward in July", "content": "<figure><div><img src=\"https://imgproxy.divecdn.com/3LgMSQE1upzvChM1wxLmhriASry7iY2wZfpw_orilEo/g:ce/rs:fill:1600:900:1/Z3M6Ly9kaXZlc2l0ZS1zdG9yYWdlL2RpdmVpbWFnZS9HZXR0eUltYWdlcy0xMjQ4NDA2NzAwXzEuanBn.webp\"/></div></figure><p>Notable deadlines for textile EPR in California and packaging EPR in Washington have passed, and New York&rsquo;s carpet EPR program is still delayed. Connecticut&rsquo;s right-to-repair law also took effect.</p>", "sources": [{"name": "waste_dive", "url": "https://www.wastedive.com/news/new-laws-july-2026-extended-producer-responsibility-textiles-carpet-packaging/824332/", "type": "rss"}]}
